dance Whirl
// The bass pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the bass sets how fast it spins and the
// highs turn it; drops in the bass reverse it; drops in the snares switch its flat spin on and
// off.
// Inspired by rotator, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.bass speed 0.8 settle 0.04
zoom follows music.mid_hit amount 0.5 settle 50
spin follows music.bass from 57.3 to 401 smooth 0.45
turn on music.high changes by 0.24
reverse on music.bass drops by 0.66 on 8 off 4
flat on music.mid_hit drops by 0.86 on 100 off 160
